# Density Compare
# Boron (B) — real density 2.34 g/cm³. equal masses: Boron vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Boron Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 15.0mm color: #ffb5b5 at (-20mm, 7.5mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 18.7 g — the water cube is the reference
